ype/math :answer/value "{x}^{2}+{y}^{2}=17" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-14792/selection/072a106b9c3b2e9b9b4db101fa71efee7af1821e4e23edd354c76cfb30e23ff9" :answer/id #uuid "e981f22e-f58c-5d7c-970c-347c755301b3" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{x}^{2}+{y}^{2}=\\sqrt{17}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-14792/selection/b515d89179f0d5a930101623dfb09c6ef5bac5d5bc5a835ac2e3aa150278a98b" :answer/id #uuid "35437fe5-455c-59de-a3c4-8a763e0abc4d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{x}^{2}+{y}^{2}=34" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-14792/selection/39691ef2eef405a9647bb11b2943948ce7bc1fa753c124a0534cec8b87c162d2" :answer/id #uuid "50b5a42d-f6fa-5bca-9451-7cef0f9f1e26" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{x}^{2}+{y}^{2}=2\\sqrt{17}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-14792/selection/f43ded2a02ef3c8428b2859db2322dcd04c1296be2bf51a29afdb869c8541bb1" :answer/id #uuid "431b9c82-735d-51c9-8fb5-193a7feed47f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{x}^{2}+{y}^{2}=68" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-14792/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "f17139a4-91d9-57e4-91f3-a7220dc96294" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-14792/selection/e6ead11e855631d62c371d2170f1d45aba2aca06cf7500435e2ab7d535b2a107" :answer-field/choices ["q-14792/selection/e6ead11e855631d62c371d2170f1d45aba2aca06cf7500435e2ab7d535b2a107" "q-14792/selection/072a106b9c3b2e9b9b4db101fa71efee7af1821e4e23edd354c76cfb30e23ff9" "q-14792/selection/b515d89179f0d5a930101623dfb09c6ef5bac5d5bc5a835ac2e3aa150278a98b" "q-14792/selection/39691ef2eef405a9647bb11b2943948ce7bc1fa753c124a0534cec8b87c162d2" "q-14792/selection/f43ded2a02ef3c8428b2859db2322dcd04c1296be2bf51a29afdb869c8541bb1"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-14792" :question/id #uuid "24a2c657-8ab6-560c-a6d6-937a612e0a3f" :question/math-academy-id "q-14792" :question/problem "![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13956996/assets/1baa0bec9c8cfdb2ce80d47e66f6ba54d34266267df3ee323a658c0f98a52f83.png)\n\nGiven that the points $X$ and $Y$ with coordinates $(1,4)$ and $(-1,-4),$ respectively, are the endpoints of a diameter of a circle centered at the origin, what is the equation of the circle?" :question/worked-solution "The equation of a circle with radius $r,$ centered at the origin, is \n\n$$\n{x}^{2}+{y}^{2}={r}^{2}.\n$$\n\nFirst, we calculate the length of the diameter $\\overset{―}{XY}:$\n  \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}XY & =\\sqrt{{(4-(-4))}^{2}+{(1-(-1))}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{{8}^{2}+{2}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{68} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{4\\cdot 17} \\\\  & =2\\sqrt{17}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSince $\\overset{―}{XY}$ is a diameter, the radius is\n\n$$\nr=\\frac{XY}{2}=\\frac{2\\sqrt{17}}{2}=\\sqrt{17}.\n$$\n\n \n\nSo, the equation of the circle is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}^{2}+{y}^{2} & ={r}^{2} \\\\ {x}^{2}+{y}^{2} & ={(\\sqrt{17})}^{2} \\\\ {x}^{2}+{y}^{2} & =17.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-14792/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "e75012ec-8203-574b-ba07-0a26e4cf4691"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-14792"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-14793/selection/0df1bf85e48f5cb2fb1ba16b22b80e903700c4bed0ef941c69f371453dd0f088" :answer/id #uuid "dc0d17fe-a39d-5eb4-9aa6-2f57718d3d9f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{x}^{2}+{y}^{2}=2\\sqrt{34}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-14793/selection/f43ded2a02ef3c8428b2859db2322dcd04c1296be2bf51a29afdb869c8541bb1" :answer/id #uuid "da3cc974-6abd-55b6-b5ff-4fd3d4666f49" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{x}^{2}+{y}^{2}=68" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-14793/selection/5cc9dcb1ae3941b988b67d3ea6fbebcab5fccdbdd88b2e2a9a2614b7ef98cd03" :answer/id #uuid "123dd0d8-5abc-5a2f-929b-10e90de5c6c4" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "